    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>LR Faq to the admin panel which allows you to show your faq on your website the easy with deffernt styles</p>\n<p>You can quickly add faq to your faq(s), display them anywhere with a easy shortcode.<br />\nit’s totally free.</p>\n<p>Faq showcase is available in five styles.<br />\nFor more features Please contact us at <a href=\"https://www.logicrays.com/contact-us/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a><br />\nIf you like this plugin Please rate us 🙂</p>\n<h3>Plugin Features</h3>\n<p>Responsive faq plugin.<br />\nAll modren browser support.<br />\nworks with anytype of theme.<br />\nEasy to customize for developeres.<br />\nEasy to configure.<br />\nEnable/Disable Expand First FAQ.<br />\nMultiple Design Options.</p>\n<h3>Shortcode</h3>\n<p>For All Faq</p>\n<pre><code>[LRFAQ]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Shortcode for number of faq</p>\n<pre><code>[LRFAQ limit=\"5\"]\n</code></pre>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload Zip file lr-faq to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"a%20question%20that%20someone%20might%20have\">\nA question that someone might have\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>An answer to that question.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20love%20your%20work%2C%20are%20you%20available%20for%20hire%3F\">\nI love your work, are you available for hire?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes I am, visit my <a href=\"https://www.logicrays.com/hire-wordpress-developers/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Hire dedicated wordpress developer</a> page to find out more.</p>\n</p>\n\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A lightweight FAQ plugin with 5 design styles, responsive layout, and easy shortcodes to showcase FAQs beautifully on any WordPress site.",
    "description": "<p>LR Faq to the admin panel which allows you to show your faq on your website the easy with deffernt styles</p>\n<p>You can quickly add faq to your faq(s), display them anywhere with a easy shortcode.<br />\nit’s totally free.</p>\n<p>Faq showcase is available in five styles.<br />\nFor more features Please contact us at <a href=\"https://www.logicrays.com/contact-us/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a><br />\nIf you like this plugin Please rate us 🙂</p>\n<h3>Plugin Features</h3>\n<p>Responsive faq plugin.<br />\nAll modren browser support.<br />\nworks with anytype of theme.<br />\nEasy to customize for developeres.<br />\nEasy to configure.<br />\nEnable/Disable Expand First FAQ.<br />\nMultiple Design Options.</p>\n<h3>Shortcode</h3>\n<p>For All Faq</p>\n<pre><code>[LRFAQ]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Shortcode for number of faq</p>\n<pre><code>[LRFAQ limit=\"5\"]\n</code></pre>\n",
